// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 4 Resistance_Leader :
"P517381492" "<t=4 d=4>It's almost time, {HeroName}! We're going to get this topside and then all you need to do is trigger it!"
// 3 Loyalist_Leader :
"P3233747422" "<em disagree t=3 d=3>And you expect me to blow up with you?"
// 4 Resistance_Leader :
"P3193410951" "<em no t=4 d=4>No, you stay down here. You'll use that device of yours to activate the bomb, once we give you the signal."
// 4 Resistance_Leader :
"P4011524184" "<t=4 d=4>You don't need to die for our cause, {HeroName}. Not today."
// 4 Loyalist_Member_One :
"P2606771161" "<t=4 d=4>We've got a problem, Wardog! The PPD found us!"
// 0 Actor5 :
"P2485660936" "<GoTo E17>"
// 0 Actor4 :
"P3712421763" "<em WalkieTalkie>"
// 2 Caption :
"P513728573" "<t=3 x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>What's your current situation?"
// 1 Actor4 :
"P3467756868" "<t=4 d=4>The Resistance have a device that can destroy all of Nova, call in EVERYONE!"
// 2 Caption :
"P3676976162" "<t=3 x= 0.2 y=0.3 d=3><scale 1.75><color red><bgcolor white>Everyone?"
// 2 Actor4 :
"P660183622" "<em frustrated t=3 d=3>EVERYONE!"
// 6 Resistance_Leader :
"P2689107983" "<t=6 d=6 em explain>Alright {HeroName}, change in plans! You've got to get as far from here as possible and activate the bomb."
// 4 Resistance_Leader :
"P1425966835" "<t=4 d=4 em evillaugh>We'll activate the Seers and show all of Praetoria that Cole is just a man, not a god!"
// LeftText :
"P3278288588" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color Paragon>Activate the Neutron Bomb</color></scale><br>Wipe out all the PPD TEST with the Neutron Bomb</span><br><br><color Paragon>Aid the Resistance</color><br>Wardog's plan to blow up the Magisterium has been thwarted, but it can still be salvaged if the bomb can take out a major unit of the PPD. You'll have to make your way up through the tunnels and activate the bomb. The Seers will ensure all of Praetoria sees what exactly the Resistance can do!<br><br><scale .8><color slategray><i>(As the story of Praetoria unfolds your character will have opportunities to change their mind and switch sides.)</i></scale>"
// RightText :
"P1465349425" "<scale 2.5><span align=center><color orange>Deactivate the Bomb</color></scale><br>Thwart the Resistance plan</span><br><br><color orange>Aid the Loyalists</color><br>With the Seers broadcasting the current events to all of Praetoria, now would be the perfect time to turn on the Resistance! All of Praetoria will see you as their 'savior', stopping this Resistance bombing plot. You'd gain the favor of the people and of the Loyalists, opening up the way to untold power within Praetoria. Who <i>wouldn't</i> give unending praise to the hero who disarmed the Neutron bomb?<br><br><i><scale .8><color slategray>(As the story of Praetoria unfolds your character will have opportunities to change their mind and switch sides.)</scale></i>"

